Haang is a free, community-driven Point-of-Sale and Inventory
Management application for small and medium enterprises (SMEs) in
Cambodia. The project is sustained through community support,
donations, grants, and training — not through the sale of the software.

Haang is incubated by the CamboVerse Center, National University of
Management (NUM).

